    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "\n2 Bedroom Apartment on North Circular Road\n\nHooke & MacDonald are delighted to present Park Lodge to the rental market. \n\nThe property offers spacious living with a bright and airy atmosphere. All bedrooms are generously sized and provide storage. \n\nPark lodge is situated in a highly sought-after area of Dublin 7, just a stone's throw from the stunning Phoenix Park, offering residents easy access to vast green spaces for outdoor activities. \n\nThe property is also within walking distance of a variety of shops, cafes, and restaurants, while excellent transport links are nearby, including numerous bus routes and the Luas Red Line."
      },
